{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":50,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我休你們的母親，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"休書在哪裏呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我將你們賣給我哪一個債主呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們被賣，是因你們的罪孽；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的母親被休，是因你們的過犯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我來的時候，為何無人等候呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼喚的時候，為何無人答應呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的膀臂豈是縮短、不能救贖嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈無拯救之力嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我一斥責，海就乾了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使江河變為曠野；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的魚因無水腥臭，乾渴而死。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使諸天以黑暗為衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以麻布為遮蓋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華僕人的順服"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"主耶和華賜我受教者的舌頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我知道怎樣用言語扶助疲乏的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主每早晨提醒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提醒我的耳朵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我能聽，像受教者一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華開通我的耳朵；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我並沒有違背，也沒有退後。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人打我的背，我任他打；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人拔我腮頰的鬍鬚，我由他拔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人辱我，吐我，我並不掩面。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"主耶和華必幫助我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我不抱愧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我硬着臉面好像堅石；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也知道我必不致蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"稱我為義的與我相近；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰與我爭論，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可以與我一同站立；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰與我作對，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可以就近我來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華要幫助我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能定我有罪呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都像衣服漸漸舊了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為蛀蟲所咬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你們中間誰是敬畏耶和華、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽從他僕人之話的？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這人行在暗中，沒有亮光。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當倚靠耶和華的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仗賴自己的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡你們點火，用火把圍繞自己的","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可以行在你們的火焰裏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並你們所點的火把中。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是我手所定的：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必躺在悲慘之中。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/50.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/51.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/49.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}